    "legacy": {
      "chapter": 7,
      "location": "前往王城途中遭王國守備軍攔截,又出手相助遭士兵圍攻的少女凱麗。凱麗加入隊伍,眾人決定直闖王城問個明白。",
      "source_dat": "FDTXT_007",
      "title": "第七章 — 王城路上,凱麗加入"
    }
  },
  "kind": "story",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": null
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/0/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "這條路是通往王城的要道,雖然走這條路較快,但遇到王國守備軍的機會也較高...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/0/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "你說的沒錯,我已經看到了。"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/0"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "王國軍攔截"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "聖"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "text": "前面那批人一定就是在普里茲港逞兇的匪徒,通通給我拿下!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/1/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "等等,大家都是自己人,這是一場誤會..."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "聖"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "text": "少玩弄詭計想拖延時間了。乖乖的受死吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/1/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "唉,說不通,只好先打再說了。索爾,我們上!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/1/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "啊?我沒問題,妳自己可要小心點,不要太勉強!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/1/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "索爾,謝謝你!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/1"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "凱麗遇襲"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 12,
              "speaker_name": "凱麗"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/2/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-12",
          "text": "哎呀!一大群男人追殺一個小姑娘,不覺得丟臉嗎?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "Y"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/2/lines/1",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/2/lines/1",
          "text": "妳的一拳讓我的部下得療養三個月,無故毆打王國駐軍可是重罪,乖乖的跟我回去說個明白吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 12,
              "speaker_name": "凱麗"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/2/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-12",
          "text": "誰教他對我亂瞄!你們王國軍都是這個樣子的嗎?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "Y"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/2/lines/3",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/2/lines/3",
          "text": "哼....不和妳吵了,給我抓起來!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/2/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "咦!那邊有王國軍在圍攻一個小女孩,這是怎麼一回事?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/2/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "喂,我們自己都顧不了了,不要再去湊熱鬧..."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/2/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "什麼!你能眼睜睜的看著一群王國軍欺負一個小女孩?我自己去收拾他們好了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/2/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "好啦好啦,我陪你去就是了,反正不差這幾個..."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/2/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "好吧,那就上吧!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/2"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": null
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "X"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/3/lines/0",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/3/lines/0",
          "text": "可惡..國王陛下,我不能再護衛您了..請原諒屬下的無能.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/3/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "你弄錯了,我們不是來加害國王的!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "X"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/3/lines/2",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/3/lines/2",
          "text": "是嗎?..那麼..前些日子到底是誰....啊...."
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/3"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "凱麗加入"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 12,
              "speaker_name": "凱麗"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/4/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-12",
          "text": "多謝你們的幫忙!連王國的精銳部隊也不是你們對手,你們到底是什麼來歷?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/4/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "這個說起來很麻煩,此地又很危險,我看妳還是回家睡覺好了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 12,
              "speaker_name": "凱麗"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/4/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-12",
          "text": "什麼,你竟敢小看我!若是聽到我老師的名字,包準你嚇一大跳...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/4/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "凱麗小姐,妳的身手的確是很不錯,可以請問妳的老師是哪一位嗎?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 12,
              "speaker_name": "凱麗"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/4/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-12",
          "text": "這個..還是不能告訴你!不過,如果你們願意讓我加入的話,我可以考慮透露一點。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/4/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "歡迎!我們就要和王國軍大戰,正愁人手不夠,有妳加入真是再好不過了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 12,
              "speaker_name": "凱麗"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/4/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-12",
          "text": "以後我們就是伙伴了,請大家多多指教!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/4/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "此地不宜久留,凱麗小姐,我們這就上路吧!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/4"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": null
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/5/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "看來我們又被人家誤會了,索爾,現在我們該怎麼辦?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/5/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "那還用說,當然是殺進王城去弄個明白!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 10,
              "speaker_name": "瑪琳"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/5/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-10",
          "text": "嗯,夠氣魄!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/5/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "我們快上路吧!這件事不弄個清楚,更麻煩的事還在後頭呢!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/e82bb0feed5c/scenes/5"
    }
